WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.800
In Water Beings, the dead stay where they fall.
The next generation grows around them.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.900
On the bench I could make a ball come out.
I could pick it up and do it again.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:23.600
Here you can see a hand.
Remember it when the view changes.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:31.700
In my first design, the mother died
giving birth.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.100
In the next design she lived.
Watch her side of the opening.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:59.700
I kept watching the child. When I looked back,
the mother had turned in the water too.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:10.100
To show this live again,
someone has to put the child back.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:18.900
The film can begin again exactly here.
What would a second birth carry from the first?
